  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25145660",
      "title": "A Closer Look At \"getStaticProps\" & Configuration Options",
      "lectureOrder": 273,
      "videoOrder": 254,
      "sourceHash": "f239f6892b007a0978c44eff365956c52848bc33e61b199b69242de44cf76660",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.08,
          "end": 5.38,
          "en": "Now before we explore more static functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.38,
          "end": 7.23,
          "en": "next.js offers to us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.23,
          "end": 9.02,
          "en": "And when we need them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.02,
          "end": 12.55,
          "en": "let's take another closer look at getStaticProps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.55,
          "end": 16.02,
          "en": "On this slide you see that I added a parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.02,
          "end": 18.28,
          "en": "called context there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.28,
          "end": 21.16,
          "en": "Because indeed this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.16,
          "end": 25.84,
          "en": "which is called by next.js receives an argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.84,
          "end": 28.56,
          "en": "We just haven't used it this far.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.56,
          "end": 32.62,
          "en": "But we do actually get an object here as our argument,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.62,
          "end": 37.62,
          "en": "as a parameter with some extra information about this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.45,
          "end": 41.503,
          "en": "when it's executed by next.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.503,
          "end": 45.17,
          "en": "And for example, we would get any dynamic params,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.17,
          "end": 48.15,
          "en": "any dynamic path segment values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.15,
          "end": 49.28,
          "en": "which we'll see in a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.28,
          "end": 50.99,
          "en": "So we'll ignore that for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.99,
          "end": 54.48,
          "en": "And we also get a couple of other pieces of information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.48,
          "end": 57.72,
          "en": "which at the moment though, don't matter to us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.72,
          "end": 59.42,
          "en": "So let's ignore this for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.42,
          "end": 61.41,
          "en": "You will see context in action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.41,
          "end": 64.05,
          "en": "throughout the next lectures though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.05,
          "end": 65.76,
          "en": "Instead, let's take a closer look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.76,
          "end": 68.34,
          "en": "at this return object again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.34,
          "end": 71.58,
          "en": "In there we see props and revalidate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.58,
          "end": 74.01,
          "en": "Now there are two other keys,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.01,
          "end": 76.92,
          "en": "which you can set on this object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.92,
          "end": 81.21000000000001,
          "en": "One key is the not found key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.21000000000001,
          "end": 83.01,
          "en": "which wants a Boolean value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.01,
          "end": 85.303,
          "en": "which is either true or false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.22,
          "end": 87.85,
          "en": "If you set this to true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.85,
          "end": 91.22,
          "en": "this page will return a four O four error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.22,
          "end": 94.92,
          "en": "and therefore render the four O four error page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.92,
          "end": 97.6,
          "en": "instead of the normal page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.6,
          "end": 100.22999999999999,
          "en": "So if I add not found true here and save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.22999999999999,
          "end": 103.493,
          "en": "if we reload we get the four O four page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.35,
          "end": 106.83,
          "en": "Now, why might we want to do that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.83,
          "end": 110.85,
          "en": "Well, if the code here where you fetch data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.85,
          "end": 114.18,
          "en": "fails to fetch the data for whatever reason,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.18,
          "end": 116.4,
          "en": "then you could for example, do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.4,
          "end": 120.12,
          "en": "So we could check if data products, length,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 120.12,
          "end": 121.807,
          "en": "if that is zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.807,
          "end": 124.49,
          "en": "So if we have no products,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.49,
          "end": 127.98,
          "en": "then maybe we want to return an object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.98,
          "end": 131.84,
          "en": "in get static props, which has not found set to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.84,
          "end": 134.21,
          "en": "So that we show the not found page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.21,
          "end": 136.94,
          "en": "and only if we have at least one product",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.94,
          "end": 141.4,
          "en": "in the fetched data, we return the regular page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 141.4,
          "end": 143.67000000000002,
          "en": "That would be a typical use case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 143.67000000000002,
          "end": 147.62,
          "en": "where you sometimes want to render the four O four page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 147.62,
          "end": 150.71,
          "en": "because you failed to fetch data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 150.71,
          "end": 152.61,
          "en": "So if I save this and reload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 152.61,
          "end": 154.44,
          "en": "Now I see that page again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 154.44,
          "end": 156.573,
          "en": "because of course we do have products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 157.49,
          "end": 161.53300000000002,
          "en": "Another key you can set is the redirect key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 162.372,
          "end": 167.372,
          "en": "The redirect key allows you to redirect the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.72,
          "end": 170.68,
          "en": "So instead of rendering the page content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 170.68,
          "end": 173.24,
          "en": "instead of rendering this component content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 173.24,
          "end": 177.07999999999998,
          "en": "you can redirect to another page, to another route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 177.07999999999998,
          "end": 178.92000000000002,
          "en": "And that could also be needed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 178.92000000000002,
          "end": 182.16,
          "en": "because maybe you failed to fetch data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 182.16,
          "end": 185.63,
          "en": "Let's say the problem is not that there is no data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 185.63,
          "end": 189.59,
          "en": "but instead you weren't able to access the database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 189.59,
          "end": 191.61,
          "en": "or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 191.61,
          "end": 194.58,
          "en": "So if there is no data to begin with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 194.58,
          "end": 198.41,
          "en": "so not just no products, but no data in general",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 198.41,
          "end": 201.87,
          "en": "then maybe you want to redirect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 201.87,
          "end": 203.78,
          "en": "Then you can do this by returning an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 203.78,
          "end": 206.91,
          "en": "where the redirect key is set to an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 206.91,
          "end": 210.12,
          "en": "where you then set a destination to some route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 210.12,
          "end": 214.37,
          "en": "For example, to the no data route, which we don't have here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 214.37,
          "end": 217.67000000000002,
          "en": "but which you could have in a project of yours, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 217.67000000000002,
          "end": 221.57999999999998,
          "en": "And where then they have where that route would be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 221.57999999999998,
          "end": 225.92000000000002,
          "en": "with a redirect status code returned by next.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 225.92000000000002,
          "end": 229.57,
          "en": "instead of this page component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 229.57,
          "end": 231.88,
          "en": "Now we don't need either of the two here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 231.88,
          "end": 233.81,
          "en": "but I wanted to mention them here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 233.81,
          "end": 237.44,
          "en": "so that you are aware of these special options,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 237.44,
          "end": 240,
          "en": "which basically can come in handy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 240,
          "end": 244.32,
          "en": "If something goes wrong with fetching your data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 244.32,
          "end": 247.22,
          "en": "And with that, that's enough for a getStaticProps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 247.22,
          "end": 249.05,
          "en": "for this very moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 249.05,
          "end": 252.63,
          "en": "Let's now have a look at another very important use case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 252.63,
          "end": 254.54,
          "en": "and very important problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 254.54,
          "end": 257.923,
          "en": "you often face in next.js projects.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
